# The arpeggios on the lead track: each P2 zone (octave, major, minor, fifth, sus4, seventh) at its four speeds
# (15, 20, 30, 60 Hz), a held note per pattern, pulse 25 %; then the sweeps down and up on short notes.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 0.5
track lead
preset 32 32 0 0 255 20 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 0 0 0 0 0
param p2 40 1
param p2 48 2
param p2 56 3
param p2 64 4
param p2 72 5
param p2 80 6
param p2 88 7
param p2 96 8
param p2 104 9
param p2 112 10
param p2 120 11
param p2 128 12
param p2 152 15
param p2 160 16
param p2 184 19
param p2 192 20
param p2 216 23
param p2 224 24
param p2 236 26
param p2 240 28
param p2 252 30
note 0 C4 4 127
note 4 C4 4 127
note 8 A3 4 127
note 12 G3 4 127
note 16 F4 4 127
note 20 G3 4 127
note 24 C6 2 127
note 26 C6 2 127
note 28 C4 2 127
note 30 C4 2 127
expect sound 0 32
expect idle 36
expect peak_below -6      # one voice peaks at -12 dBFS; a releasing note overlaps the next
